Core/Jessie: How did no one predict this?
Core/Rose: People did. Ecologists, epidemiologists. We were screaming about insect resistance and pathogen evolution for years.
Core/Jessie: But no one listened.
Core/Rose: Not until it was too late. And by then…
Core/Jessie: I’m sorry. That must be… frustrating.
Core/Rose: Frustrating doesn’t even cover it.